BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ReBuild Ukraine: Construction &amp\;amp\; Energy
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTSTAMP:20260923T160036Z
UID:7879e83cc92cae5f@waw-calendars
CATEGORIES:targi
DESCRIPTION:6th International Exhibition & Conference ReBuild Ukraine: Con
 struction & Energy is the offline platform for recovery projects\, technol
 ogies\, equipment\, and investments essential to rebuild Ukraine’s war-t
 orn economy\, with a focus on infrastructure\, industry\, energy\, and hou
 sing. Global focus\, local impact. Here\, international companies meet the
  needs of Ukrainian communities\, showcase technologies\, explore financin
 g\, and forge partnerships. From energy-efficient solutions to large-scale
  infrastructure recovery — no other event offers such depth and focus on
  real needs. Who is this event for? For government bodies and internationa
